# Local-only secrets for `wrangler dev` / `next dev`. Never commit real values.
# Copy to `.dev.vars` and fill in for local development.
# SESSION_SECRET=change-me-locally
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
# Generate with `npx web-push generate-vapid-keys` — set once per environment,
# same pair on staging and prod is fine, but keep the private key secret.
# VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=
# VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=
